    "text": "kmvt\nwebsite\nTwin Falls\nYour Hometown Forecast July 16, 2025 PM\n50 minutes ago\nPolls are open from eight in the morning to eight in the evening. If you have an absentee ballot that you haven’t turned in, you can bring it in to be counted. If you’re looking for some gear to support your favorite Magic Valley team, a store in Burley is the place to go!",
